        <mxCell id="alt-65" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;text;strokeOpacity=0;fillOpacity=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="6. Review urgent requests and assign priority." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="58" width="510" x="1260" y="646" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="alt-66" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;text;strokeOpacity=0;fillOpacity=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="7. View activity summaries generated by the system." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="58" width="510" x="1260" y="716" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PhWo7JzhQhLb9IQ3xxpj-1" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=21;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;text;strokeOpacity=0;fillOpacity=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;" value="Platform rules supporting the request lifecycle" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="35" width="1750" x="-50" y="980" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PhWo7JzhQhLb9IQ3xxpj-2" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;text;strokeOpacity=0;fillOpacity=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="• One selected helper per request; new offers stop after acceptance. Users cannot offer help on their own requests.&#xa;• A Helper must not repost an accepted task to transfer it to another helper; they must notify the Client and withdraw if unable to continue.&#xa;• Request states: Open, Assigned, In Progress, Completed, Cancelled, Expired. An unfinished open request expires at its deadline; an active task is flagged overdue.&#xa;• Expired/cancelled requests stay in history. Adding new software features is a developer responsibility; Admins manage categories and existing settings." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="1750" x="-50" y="1030" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
